4-0b45-4619-839b-14d329a00e01\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a RichTextLabel by code (instantiating a scene or creating a new RTL with enough size)\n- Add some text using add_text() or append_text()\n- Add the RTL to the tree with add_child()\n\nCan be done on a brand new project. I added a Minimal reproduction project anyway.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[orphan_RTL_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18232032/orphan_RTL_test.zip)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100772/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}